  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingalana Miriam nko Aron Musa nyo gha, ompöwölo kip chepö Kusyin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö, “Köngölonï ECHOTYON so kuwerï Musa onkït? Möngölonunye kuwerï acha tïkwïlï?” Kïlïm ECHOTYON ngalekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki chi Musa nyo kitalas kïtïl pich löwïr cho kimi ngwïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa nko Aron nko Miriam, “Omökan akwa kï sömök apkanakwa Ema.” Kïpa chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrökunö ECHOTYON pchöri polta akughyongö kuka Ema, akïkur Aron nko Miriam, kïpka chane kwodeny tagh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON chane, “Atera ngalechï! Atomi werkoyonta nyo mi kwenunkwa, oporchinan kegh nyinte ompö sïwïyagh, angölonchan nyinte ompö kirwotïtogh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Epr 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo sis ompö mötworintenyan Musa, ompöwölo kotönön nyinte kuntöghoghchï piköchan pipö Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona ongölonan nko nyinte kïsïwïyanïn amelö ompö tuwïn, kikïsïwa nyinte wölo alatan ECHOTYON. Ompö ne nyu tömowöghekwa angalanena nyo gha mötworintenyan Musa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnyala ECHOTYON ompö chane akïwechï kegh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kingeta poltonay paraku Ema, kïnam Miriam psenkwet kïrelit por lö, pöt le takarïs. Otini kiwaghaka Aron kuros Miriam akïsïwa lö, kinam psenkwet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Aron Musa, “Echotyontenyu, mekonecha sitöt ompöwölo kakighacha ngokï ompö sölwontön. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mekany kïlïkwï nyinte chi nyo kikïyï kima akïrarteghate kareranto portanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlokyï Musa ECHOTYON lö, “Osoghinyi, we Tororöt lö, sopö nyinte.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.5.2+NUM.5.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 5:2-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Antökösïngwïlchï paponyi nyinte tokoch, mökönyorunye arasï ompö osis mut nko odeny? Nya kekörchï nyinte sanypa möngot ompö osis mut nko odeny atolapay keyokwï ngat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kekörchï Miriam sanypa möngot ompö osis mut nko odeny, amelö kitökïwï pich ntökïtenö kïmïla Miriam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngeta nyu Aserot ntökwit surkwen pö Paran, kïmang atoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghotï",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
